            <description><![CDATA[## v1.0.1-beta.1

  ### Improvements
  - Polished notch opening, closing, tab switching, HUD, battery, and layout motion.
  - Improved Shelf drops, Calendar authorization refresh, and built-in display brightness handling.
  - Refreshed demo media and documentation.

  ### Fixes
  - Stable Sparkle appcast publishing.
  - Issue-report version dropdown.
  - Release signing and CodeQL build reliability.

  **Full Changelog**: `v1.0.0...v1.0.1-beta.1`
]]></description>
